{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/calculus/applications-integration/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/calculus/applications-integration.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Applications of Integration — Calculus","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<header class=\"bg-rose-600 text-white py-3 mb-6\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"font-semibold\">Applications — Integration</div><a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/calculus/\" class=\"text-white/90\">Back</a></div></header>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-6\">\n    <section class=\"card\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Area &amp; Accumulation</h2><div class=\"muted mt-2\">Definite integrals compute accumulated quantities like area, distance, and total change: ∫_a^b f(x) dx.</div></section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Visual — area between curve and axis</h2>\n      <div class=\"mt-3 muted\">Area under y = x from 0 to 2 equals 2 (triangle area).</div>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 flex justify-center\">\n        <svg width=\"420\" height=\"160\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <path d=\"M60,120 L140,60 L220,120 Z\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#fb7185\"></path>\n          <text x=\"140\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#374151\">Area under curve from 0 to 2</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Worked examples</h2>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside mt-3 muted\">\n        <li>Area under y = x from 0 to 2: ∫_0^2 x dx = 2.</li>\n        <li>Displacement from v(t)=3t^2 over [0,2] = 8.</li>\n        <li>Area ∫_0^3 2x dx = [x^2]_0^3 = 9.</li>\n        <li>Area ∫_0^2 x^2 dx = [x^3/3]_0^2 = 8/3.</li>\n      </ol>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Practice</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-3\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">1) Find ∫_0^3 2x dx</div><input id=\"ai1\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 9\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"aic1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-rose-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"aih1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"aifb1\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">2) Given v(t)=3t^2, displacement from 0 to 2?</div><input id=\"ai2\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 8\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"aic2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-rose-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"aih2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"aifb2\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">3) Evaluate ∫_0^2 x^2 dx</div><input id=\"ai3\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 8/3\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"aic3\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-rose-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"aih3\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"aifb3\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">4) Find ∫_0^1 x dx</div><input id=\"ai4\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 1/2\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"aic4\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-rose-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"aih4\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"aifb4\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"text-right\"><button id=\"aiQuiz\" class=\"bg-rose-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded\">Mini Quiz</button></div>\n  </main>\n\n  <div id=\"aiModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 z-40 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded p-6 max-w-md w-full\"><div id=\"aiContent\"></div><div class=\"mt-4 text-right\"><button id=\"aiClose\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Close</button></div></div></div>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-rose-50 font-sans","bodyStyle":"","css":[".card{background:#fff;padding:1rem;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.06)} .muted{color:#374151}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}